{"seq":3,"slug":"arbitration-pre-arbitration","title":"Pre-arbitration 与仲裁阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/evidence-representment/arbitration-pre-arbitration","wordCount":1647,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"pre-arbitration-与仲裁阶段\">Pre-arbitration 与仲裁阶段</h1><p>走到这一步，双方都已经把材料交过一轮，发卡行仍然坚持拒付。此时争议从「举证是否充分」变成「谁愿意为这个结论继续付费」。Pre-arbitration 是最后一道<strong>低成本</strong>关口，仲裁是唯一一次<strong>终局裁决</strong>——裁决不可上诉，且费用由败诉方承担。这一篇的核心不是法律，而是<strong>经济性判定</strong>：什么时候该继续投入，什么时候该认赔止损。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-升级路径与费用结构\">核心概念：升级路径与费用结构</h2><p>从举证被拒到终局，路径是：<code>Representment 被拒 → Pre-arbitration → Arbitration</code>。每一级的费用量级不同，且费用的承担规则与胜负直接挂钩。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>谁付费</th>\n<th>胜负影响费用</th>\n<th>可撤回</th>\n<th>证据是否需新增</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Representment</td>\n<td>通常不收单次费用</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>首次完整举证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pre-arbitration</td>\n<td>发起方付费（较低）</td>\n<td>败诉方承担</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>通常需补强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Arbitration</td>\n<td>发起方预付（显著更高）</td>\n<td>败诉方承担全部</td>\n<td><strong>不可</strong></td>\n<td>需完整且一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里有三个工程含义。<strong>第一，费用结构决定阈值</strong>：仲裁费用往往是争议金额的数倍，所以「争议金额低于仲裁成本」的案件不应该进仲裁——哪怕你确信自己会赢，赢得回来的钱也不够付费用。<strong>第二，pre-arbitration 是可以撤回的</strong>，这意味着它是可以试探的；而仲裁一旦发起就没有回头路。<strong>第三，仲裁要求材料完整且一致</strong>：如果仲裁阶段提交的证据与 representment 阶段存在矛盾，会被直接判负，这也是为什么 <a href=\"../evidence-representment/evidence-package-assembly\">举证包自动组装</a> 强调时点一致性与哈希留痕。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经济性判定-一个可执行的决策模型\">经济性判定：一个可执行的决策模型</h2><p>把决策写成模型而不是凭经验，才能规模化且可审计。设争议金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，举证胜诉概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，该阶段成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，败诉时还需承担对方费用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（若规则如此）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"期望收益与胜率门槛\">期望收益与胜率门槛</h3><p>进入某阶段期望收益近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>gain</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\text{gain}] = p \\cdot A - (1-p)\\cdot C_o - C_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gain</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>gain</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\text{gain}] &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gain</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时才值得进入。这个式子最直接的应用是<strong>反推胜诉概率门槛</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>简化形式取决于费用规则</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^* = \\frac{A - C_s + C_o}{A + C_o} \\quad (\\text{简化形式取决于费用规则})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">简化形式取决于费用规则</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践上更稳妥的做法是用历史数据估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 而不是解析求解</p>\n<h3 id=\"政策配置化-因为费用规则随网络与地区变化-且部分费用按笔还是按金额计也影响结论-可直接落地成配置\">政策配置化，因为费用规则随网络与地区变化，且部分费用按笔还是按金额计也影响结论。可直接落地成配置：</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;escalation_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;pre_arbitration&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;min_case_amount&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 5000, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot; },&#10;      &quot;min_historical_win_rate&quot;: 0.45,&#10;      &quot;require_new_evidence&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;auto_accept_below_amount&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 2500, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;arbitration&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;min_case_amount&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 25000, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot; },&#10;      &quot;min_historical_win_rate&quot;: 0.6,&#10;      &quot;require_human_approval&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;evidence_consistency_check&quot;: &quot;strict&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"escalation_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"pre_arbitration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_case_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_historical_win_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require_new_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"auto_accept_below_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"arbitration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_case_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_historical_win_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require_human_approval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence_consistency_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"strict\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个门槛值各有理由：<code>min_case_amount</code> 保证争议金额足够覆盖费用；<code>min_historical_win_rate</code> 用同原因码同证据类型的历史胜率做先验；<code>require_new_evidence</code> 是因为<strong>在没有新证据的情况下重复同样的主张，胜率通常不会提高</strong>——如果 pre-arb 的材料与 representment 完全一致，多数情况下只是多付一次费用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"什么时候应该主动认赔\">什么时候应该主动认赔</h3><p>认赔不是失败，它是一个计算过的决策。以下情况应默认认赔，而不是继续升级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>争议金额低于该阶段的总成本（费用 + 人力）。</li>\n<li>历史胜率显著低于门槛，且<strong>没有新增证据的可能</strong>。</li>\n<li>证据链存在已发现的矛盾（时点不一致、退款流水冲突）。</li>\n<li>原因码本身指向「商户处理错误」（例如确属平台重复扣款）——这类案件升级胜率极低。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后一条尤其重要：<strong>处理错误类争议应当被修复源头而不是打赢</strong>。如果你的幂等机制导致了重复扣款，正确的动作是修复幂等、并把这类案件直接从升级流程排除，而不是花仲裁费用去辩解。这是 <a href=\"../dispute-case-ops/win-rate-root-cause\">胜诉率与败诉归因</a> 里「可修复缺陷」与「不可控风险」的分界线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仲裁证据的准备与一致性\">仲裁证据的准备与一致性</h2><p>仲裁阶段的材料要求高于前序阶段，核心是<strong>完整、一致、可验证</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三项强制预检\">三项强制预检</h3><p>工程上要在提交前强制三项检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"arbitration_preflight(case):&#10;  1. 一致性：本次材料集合必须包含 representment 阶段提交的同一批证据哈希&#10;     assert set(now.sha256) ⊇ set(representment.sha256)&#10;  2. 完整性：原因码规则要求的证据类型全部 present，不允许 DEGRADED&#10;     assert now.missing == []&#10;  3. 可验证性：每份附件有哈希；关键字段与网络交易记录一致&#10;     assert all(item.sha256 for item in now.items)&#10;     assert now.transaction_identifier == network_txn_id&#10;&#10;  4. 成本闸门：金额与胜率门槛均通过，且有审批记录&#10;     assert policy.arbitration.check(case) and case.approvals.exists()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>arbitration_preflight(case):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 一致性：本次材料集合必须包含 representment 阶段提交的同一批证据哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     assert set(now.sha256) ⊇ set(representment.sha256)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 完整性：原因码规则要求的证据类型全部 present，不允许 DEGRADED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     assert now.missing == []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 可验证性：每份附件有哈希；关键字段与网络交易记录一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     assert all(item.sha256 for item in now.items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     assert now.transaction_identifier == network_txn_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 成本闸门：金额与胜率门槛均通过，且有审批记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     assert policy.arbitration.check(case) and case.approvals.exists()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 1 条容易被忽略：工程师在 pre-arb 阶段补强材料时，可能<strong>替换</strong>了原来的妥投截图（比如换了更清晰的一版），导致哈希不一致。正确做法是<strong>追加</strong>新版本并保留旧版本，让材料集合是超集而非替换。第 4 条的审批记录是治理要求——终局且费用高的动作不应由自动化系统单独决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段结束后的状态收敛\">阶段结束后的状态收敛</h2><p>无论仲裁结果是胜是负，案件都必须正确收口，否则会污染下游指标。要点是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>资金</strong>：按裁决结果核销或追认损失，写入账务凭证（不要直接改余额）。</li>\n<li><strong>指标</strong>：已裁决案件才进入胜诉率分母；超时未答复的案件单独归类，不与证据不足混淆。</li>\n<li><strong>网络侧状态</strong>：以网络回执为准同步本地状态，不要用本地推断覆盖网络真实结果。</li>\n<li><strong>归因</strong>：把这次升级的胜负原因写入案件，作为后续同类案件的先验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>另一个容易遗漏的收口动作是<strong>撤回未决的 pre-arbitration</strong>：如果你在 pre-arb 期间已经通过其它途径（例如退款）解决了问题，应当主动撤回而不是放任它到期，否则会产生不必要的费用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与超时缺陷类的区分\">与超时缺陷类的区分</h3><p>这里必须与本 hub 的时间模型对齐：<strong>仲裁阶段的「不可上诉」只针对裁决结果，不针对流程错误</strong>。如果你因为内部时钟问题错过了 pre-arb 的答复窗口，那不是「裁决输了」，而是流程缺陷，应当在归因里单独计一类。混在一起会让你误判升级策略的有效性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Pre-arbitration 是最后一次低成本关口且可撤回；仲裁是终局、不可上诉、成本最高。</li>\n<li>升级决策应写成期望收益模型（金额 × 胜率 vs 费用），而不是凭经验判断。</li>\n<li>无新增证据的重复主张通常不值得升级；处理错误类争议应修复源头而非打赢。</li>\n<li>仲裁材料必须与前序阶段<strong>保持哈希一致且只能追加</strong>，不允许替换。</li>\n<li>终局动作需要人工审批与政策闸门，不应全自动执行。</li>\n<li>案件收口要同时处理资金、指标、网络状态与归因四件事。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Representment 被拒] --&gt; B{金额 &gt;= pre-arb 门槛?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[主动认赔]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{有新增证据?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E{历史胜率达标?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| C&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[发起 Pre-arbitration]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F&#10;  F --&gt; G{发卡行接受?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[结案,资金退回]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I{金额 &gt;= 仲裁门槛&lt;br/&gt;且胜率达标?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| C&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[一致性 + 完整性预检]&#10;  J --&gt;|不通过| C&#10;  J --&gt;|通过| K[人工审批后发起仲裁]&#10;  K --&gt; L[终局裁决]&#10;  L --&gt; M[资金核销 + 指标归因]&#10;  C --&gt; M\">flowchart TD\n  A[Representment 被拒] --&gt; B{金额 &gt;= pre-arb 门槛?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[主动认赔]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{有新增证据?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E{历史胜率达标?}\n  E --&gt;|否| C\n  D --&gt;|是| F[发起 Pre-arbitration]\n  E --&gt;|是| F\n  F --&gt; G{发卡行接受?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[结案,资金退回]\n  G --&gt;|否| I{金额 &gt;= 仲裁门槛&lt;br/&gt;且胜率达标?}\n  I --&gt;|否| C\n  I --&gt;|是| J[一致性 + 完整性预检]\n  J --&gt;|不通过| C\n  J --&gt;|通过| K[人工审批后发起仲裁]\n  K --&gt; L[终局裁决]\n  L --&gt; M[资金核销 + 指标归因]\n  C --&gt; M</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Pre-arbitration 与仲裁阶段","id":"pre-arbitration-与仲裁阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：升级路径与费用结构","id":"核心概念-升级路径与费用结构"},{"level":2,"text":"经济性判定：一个可执行的决策模型","id":"经济性判定-一个可执行的决策模型"},{"level":3,"text":"期望收益与胜率门槛","id":"期望收益与胜率门槛"},{"level":3,"text":"政策配置化，因为费用规则随网络与地区变化，且部分费用按笔还是按金额计也影响结论。可直接落地成配置：","id":"政策配置化-因为费用规则随网络与地区变化-且部分费用按笔还是按金额计也影响结论-可直接落地成配置"},{"level":3,"text":"什么时候应该主动认赔","id":"什么时候应该主动认赔"},{"level":2,"text":"仲裁证据的准备与一致性","id":"仲裁证据的准备与一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"三项强制预检","id":"三项强制预检"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段结束后的状态收敛","id":"阶段结束后的状态收敛"},{"level":3,"text":"与超时缺陷类的区分","id":"与超时缺陷类的区分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"举证模板与网络门户/API 提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/evidence-representment/representment-template-network"},"next":{"title":"争议案件工作流与分派","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/case-workflow-assignment"}}